{
    "name": "agent-recipes",
    "title": "Agent recipes",
    "description": "Save configurable owner-managed recipes and start roles from an exact run preview. Direct Save and Run use public Pocket 0.16 APIs. The optional read-only status tool uses the experimental host-linked list API. Reads no outside files or secrets and makes no direct network calls or processes. Linked agents use normal tools and providers; work modes are instructions, not a sandbox.",
